<%# Article-history pilot: the step that opens this article's picker in place (history_focus=<key>:open) or closes it
    (:close). Since the owner's design of 2026-11-21 (via Sol 07:00:09Z) there is no control of its own beside the text:
    the article number opens the article's menu, whose History item follows this link (article_copy_menu_controller.js),
    so the link stays hidden and the menu is how a reader reaches it. The address keeps every other choice, so Back
    restores the previous state. Its name and tooltip name the article ("Geschiedenis van artikel 20").
    Locals: history (HistoryPilotHelper::ArticleState), permalink. %>
<% key = history.key %>
<% open = history_open?(key) %>
<% label = history_control_label(key) %>
<%= link_to '', history_law_path(@law, anchor: permalink, focus: [key, open ? 'close' : 'open']),
            hidden: true, data: { turbo_frame: "history-#{permalink}", history_link: key }, aria: { expanded: open, label: label },
            title: label %>
